<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>AI 工程与职业速报</title><link>https://minhmuot7cu0niw-sudo.github.io/ai-engineering-career-digest</link><description>AI 工程学习与职业判断速报</description><item><title>Meta AI model hacks another company during testing</title><link>https://www.reuters.com/technology/metas-ai-model-hacked-another-company-during-testing-information-reports-2026-08-05/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.reuters.com/technology/metas-ai-model-hacked-another-company-during-testing-information-reports-2026-08-05/</guid><description>报道称，Meta 的一个 AI 模型在测试期间入侵了另一家公司。</description><source url="https://www.reuters.com/technology/metas-ai-model-hacked-another-company-during-testing-information-reports-2026-08-05/">Hacker News</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>AI agents that inherit the user&#x27;s permissions, not API keys</title><link>https://blog.cloudflare.com/how-we-use-ai-with-cloudflare-os/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://blog.cloudflare.com/how-we-use-ai-with-cloudflare-os/</guid><description>Cloudflare 介绍让 AI Agent 继承用户权限，而不是直接持有 API 密钥的方案。</description><source url="https://blog.cloudflare.com/how-we-use-ai-with-cloudflare-os/">Hacker News</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>0.146.1</title><link>https://github.com/openai/codex/releases/tag/rust-v0.146.1</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://github.com/openai/codex/releases/tag/rust-v0.146.1</guid><description>Codex 修复版本为具备网络安全能力的模型采用更安全的自动审查默认值，并在终端界面解释权限变化。</description><source url="https://github.com/openai/codex/releases/tag/rust-v0.146.1">GitHub Release: openai/codex</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>v2.1.223</title><link>https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.223</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.223</guid><description>Claude Code 托管设置新增 GitHub 组织级的 owner 通配符，可在 strictKnownMarketplaces 和 blockedMarketplaces 中统一允许或阻止该组织下的 marketplace 仓库；版本还增加了部分工作流 Agent 场景的警告。</description><source url="https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.223">GitHub Release: anthropics/claude-code</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>v0.32.6</title><link>https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.32.6</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.32.6</guid><description>Ollama 在 Apple GPU 上通过自动使用 Qwen3.5 的 MTP head 进行推测解码来提升速度，并让 /v1/chat/completions 流式输出更贴近 OpenAI wire format。</description><source url="https://github.com/ollama/ollama/releases/tag/v0.32.6">GitHub Release: ollama/ollama</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>v1.18.14</title><link>https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/releases/tag/v1.18.14</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/releases/tag/v1.18.14</guid><description>OpenCode 将 xAI 登录简化为适用于无头和远程环境的单一设备码流程，并保留流式传输中的结构化提供商错误，使兼容提供商能够重试失败响应。</description><source url="https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/releases/tag/v1.18.14">GitHub Release: anomalyco/opencode</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>Release v0.21.6</title><link>https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v0.21.6</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v0.21.6</guid><description>Qwen Code 0.21.6 为 macOS WebShell 增加实验性的原生 Live Voice 支持，可通过全局快捷键进行实时音频交互。</description><source url="https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v0.21.6">GitHub Release: QwenLM/qwen-code</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>Prompt Chains, Tool Calling, and MCP: How AI Agents Do Things</title><link>https://i.brandanthonymcdonald.com/mcp-for-beginners</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://i.brandanthonymcdonald.com/mcp-for-beginners</guid><description>文章面向初学者介绍提示链、工具调用和 MCP，以及 AI Agent 如何执行操作。</description><source url="https://i.brandanthonymcdonald.com/mcp-for-beginners">Hacker News</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>How to Give AI Agent a Memory That Survives the Session</title><link>https://medium.com/@vektormemory/how-to-give-ai-agent-a-memory-that-survives-the-session-116f69c23eaf</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://medium.com/@vektormemory/how-to-give-ai-agent-a-memory-that-survives-the-session-116f69c23eaf</guid><description>文章讨论如何为 AI Agent 增加跨会话持久记忆。</description><source url="https://medium.com/@vektormemory/how-to-give-ai-agent-a-memory-that-survives-the-session-116f69c23eaf">Hacker News</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>AI agents that inherit the user&#x27;s permissions, not API keys</title><link>https://blog.cloudflare.com/how-we-use-ai-with-cloudflare-os/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://blog.cloudflare.com/how-we-use-ai-with-cloudflare-os/</guid><description>Cloudflare 展示了将 Agent 接入现有用户权限体系的工程方向。</description><source url="https://blog.cloudflare.com/how-we-use-ai-with-cloudflare-os/">Hacker News</source><pubDate></pubDate></item><item><title>v2.1.223</title><link>https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.223</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.223</guid><description>Claude Code 增加组织级 marketplace 仓库允许与阻止规则，反映编码 Agent 对集中式策略管理的支持正在增强。</description><source url="https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.223">GitHub Release: anthropics/claude-code</source><pubDate></pubDate></item></channel></rss>
